## Included Components

### fwcd/vscode-kotlin
- **Project**: https://github.com/fwcd/vscode-kotlin
- **License**: Apache License 2.0
- **Location**: `src/vscode-kotlin/`
- **Modifications**: Integrated with patched debug adapter

### fwcd/kotlin-debug-adapter
- **Project**: https://github.com/fwcd/kotlin-debug-adapter
- **License**: Apache License 2.0
- **Location**: `src/kotlin-debug-adapter/`
- **Modifications**:
  - Added SMAP stratum-aware line mapping in `JDIDebuggee.kt`
  - Exception handling for three-argument `locationsOfLine`
  - Upgraded Kotlin version to 2.1.0 for compatibility

